# Consumer keep rules for :feature:widget, applied to the app's R8 run.

# Glance instantiates ActionCallbacks by class name through the no-arg constructor; Glance's own rule keeps
# the class but not the constructor. Without it, widget taps fail with an InstantiationException.
-keepclassmembers class * extends androidx.glance.appwidget.action.ActionCallback { <init>(); }

# Glance persists the provider's canonical name in its DataStore and the app looks widgets up with
# getGlanceIds(widget.javaClass). A renamed class makes placed widgets undetectable after an upgrade.
-keepnames class * extends androidx.glance.appwidget.GlanceAppWidget
